 "summary": "The PR descends the existing fractional-ideal\u2194Weil-divisor isomorphism to the class-group quotient, reusing TauCeti (`fractionalIdealDivisorAddEquiv`, `OrderSystem` class-group API) and Mathlib (`ClassGroup.equiv`, `QuotientAddGroup.congr`, `MulEquiv.toAdditive`) throughout with no re-derivation. Mathlib has no Weil-divisor-class-group bridge to duplicate, the only sibling `classGroupAddEquivPicZeroProdInt` is a different (generic degree-splitting) map, and the one added helper `divisorClass_eq_mk'` has no existing equivalent.",
